Package: pairwiseAdonis
Title: Pairwise Multilevel Comparison using Adonis
Version: 0.5.0
Date: 2026-10-05
Authors@R: c(person("Pedro", "Martinez Arbizu", email = "pmartinez@senckenberg.de", role = "aut"),
             person("Sylvain", "Monteux", role = "aut"),
             person("James", "Weldon", email = "JWeld@users.noreply.github.com", role = c("ctb", "cre"),
                    comment = "maintainer of this fork"))
Description: This is a wrapper function for multilevel pairwise comparison using adonis2() from package 'vegan'.
			The function returns adjusted p-values using p.adjust().
Depends: R (>= 3.5.0), vegan (>= 2.6-4), permute
Imports: cluster, stats, utils
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0)
